  "body": "Crafted in 2010 by trusted Signature Homes, this extraordinary coastal sanctuary delivers grand proportions, ultimate privacy, and an idyllic lifestyle on a massive 4,313 m² (more or less) freehold section surrounded by native bush.\r\n\r\nIf you are searching for an affordable haven on the Peninsula where you can move straight in, add your own personal touches, and build serious future value, your search ends today.\r\n\r\nPrepare to fall in love with the totally private, north facing outdoor entertaining area with seamless flow to the beautiful solar heated swimming pool. The surrounding native bush creates a peaceful sanctuary for children to explore, pets to roam, and resident birdlife to enjoy. Peace, privacy, and sunshine abound from this very special sanctuary, making you feel as though you are on holiday all rear round.\r\n\r\nThe newly carpeted master bedroom suite enjoys its own private wing with dedicated access, featuring a separate lounge and private deck for ultimate relaxation. The children’s wing provides another two bedrooms, plus a study/guest room, family bathroom, separate toilet, and a dedicated laundry space. On the entry level, a versatile hobby room (currently set up as a guest room) has its own direct access, offering an ideal space for a work from home office, artist studio, home gym, or personal business set-up. The flexible floor plan is perfectly tailored for growing families. An internal double garage provides secure parking and additional storage, while generous off-street parking for four to five vehicles ensures there is plenty of space for the boat, campervan and visiting guests. \r\n\r\nEverything you need is close at hand– Local shops, restaurants, eateries, and supermarket. The eagerly anticipated Pen Link (currently on track for completion 2029), Whangaparaoa Bus station that will connect residents on the Peninsula with buses to the North Shore and City Centre via the Pen Link when it opens. Coast Plaza, local beaches, Stanmore Bay Leisure Centre, local colleges, and schools are within easy reach; a short drive to Gulf Harbour for the ferry to the city – Grandparents will love the FREE ride for over 65s (conditions apply).\r\n\r\nWe look forward to showing you through this unique piece of paradise.",
